#: main.cpp:28
msgid "Sweeper"
msgstr "Leuwagen"

#: main.cpp:29
msgid "Helps clean unwanted traces the user leaves on the system."
msgstr ""
"Hölpt bi't Wegmaken vun Sporen, de Brukers op't Systeem nalaat, ahn dat se "
"dat wüllt."

